<doc id="185230" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185230" title="Noach (parsyah)">
Noach (parsyah)

Noach, Noiach, Nauach, Nauah, utawa Noah (נֹחַ, &lt;a href="Basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kanggo jeneng "&lt;a href="Nuh"&gt;Nuh&lt;/a&gt;", kata katelu, lan &lt;a href="incipit"&gt;kata distinsif kapisan&lt;/a&gt;, saka parsyah kasebut) yaiku &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) kapindho ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan. Wacaan kasebut ngaliputi Purwaning Dumadi 6:9-11:32. Parsyah kasebut nyritake crita &lt;a href="air%20bah"&gt;air bah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="bahtera%20Nuh"&gt;bahtera Nuh&lt;/a&gt;, Nuh mendem lan banjur kuwi ngakutuk &lt;a href="Kanaan%20%28tokoh%20Alkitab%29"&gt;Kanaan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Menara%20Babil"&gt;Menara Babil&lt;/a&gt;.
Parsyah kasebut nduweni cacah ayat paling akeh ing wacaan Torèt saben minggu ing Kitab Purwaning Dumadi (sanadyan dudu paling akeh ing cacah aksara utawa tembung). Parsyah kasebut kalebu 6.907 aksara Ibrani, 1.861 tembung Ibrani, 153 ayat, lan 230 baris ing &lt;a href="Gulungan%20Kitab%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;Gulungan Kitab Torèt&lt;/a&gt; (סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה, Sefer Torah). Ing Kitab Purwaning Dumadi, Parsyah &lt;a href="Miketz"&gt;Miketz&lt;/a&gt; nduweni aksara paling akeh, Parsyah &lt;a href="Vayeira"&gt;Vayeira&lt;/a&gt; nduweni tembung paling akeh, lan Parsyah &lt;a href="Vayishlach"&gt;Vayishlach&lt;/a&gt; nduweni cacah ayat sing padha karo Parsyah Noach.
&lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; ngawacane ing &lt;a href="Sabat"&gt;Sabat&lt;/a&gt; kapindho sawise &lt;a href="Simchat%20Torah"&gt;Simchat Torah&lt;/a&gt;, umume ing Oktober utawa wiwit November.
<h2>Cathetan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="185231" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185231" title="Lech-Lecha">
Lech-Lecha

Lech-Lecha, Lekh-Lekha, utawa Lech-L'cha (לֶךְ-לְךָ leḵ-ləḵā — &lt;a href="Basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "dalan!" utawa "lunga!", secara harfiah artine "sampeyan dalan" — &lt;a href="incipit"&gt;tembung kalima lan kaenem&lt;/a&gt; ing parsyah kasebut) menika &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) katelu ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan. Wacaan kasebut ngeliputi Purwaning Dumadi 12:1-17:27. Parsyah kasebut nyritani crita Gusti Allah nimbali Abram (sing banjur kuwe dadi &lt;a href="Abraham"&gt;Abraham&lt;/a&gt;), Abram &lt;a href="Citra%20garwa-saudari%20ing%20Kitab%20Purwaning%20Dumadi"&gt;ngangkat garwane&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sarah"&gt;Sarai&lt;/a&gt; minangka saudarine, Abram ngabagi &lt;a href="Tanah%20Israel"&gt;tanah&lt;/a&gt; karo kaponakane &lt;a href="Lot%20%28Alkitab%29"&gt;Lot&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pertempuran%20Siddim"&gt;perang antawisipun papan raja lan limang kutha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="prajanjian%20babagan%20katurunan"&gt;prajanjian babagan katurunan&lt;/a&gt;, kategangan Sarai karo palayanne &lt;a href="Hagar%20%28Alkitab%29"&gt;Hagar&lt;/a&gt; lan putra Hagar &lt;a href="Ishmael"&gt;Ishmael&lt;/a&gt;, lan prajanjian sunat (בְּרִית מִילָה, &lt;a href="brit%20milah"&gt;brit milah&lt;/a&gt;).
Parsyah kasebut kalebu 6.336 aksara Ibrani, 1.686 tembung Ibrani, 12 ayat lan 208 baris ing &lt;a href="gulungan%20Kitab%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;gulungan Kitab Torèt&lt;/a&gt; (סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה, Sefer Torah). &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; ngewacane ing &lt;a href="Sabat"&gt;Sabat&lt;/a&gt; katelu sawise &lt;a href="Simchat%20Torah"&gt;Simchat Torah&lt;/a&gt;, ing Oktober utawa November.
<h2>Cathetan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="185232" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185232" title="Vayeira">
Vayeira

Vayeira, Vayera, utawa Va-yera (וַיֵּרָא — &lt;a href="basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "lan Ia nongol", &lt;a href="incipit"&gt;tembung kapisan&lt;/a&gt; ing parsyah kasebut) yaiku &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) kapapat ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan. Wacaan kasebut ngeliputi Purwaning Dumadi 18:1–22:24. Parsyah kasebut ngisahke crita telung tetamu &lt;a href="Abraham"&gt;Abraham&lt;/a&gt;, tawar menawar Abraham karo &lt;a href="Allah%20ing%20Yudaisme"&gt;Gusti Allah&lt;/a&gt; babagan &lt;a href="Sodom%20lan%20Gomorrah"&gt;Sodom lan Gomorrah&lt;/a&gt;, loro tetamu &lt;a href="Lot"&gt;Lot&lt;/a&gt;, tawar menawar Lot karo wong-wong Sodom, Lot uwal, pangancuran Sodom lan Gomorrah, putri-putri Lot ngaperkosa ramane, Abraham ngangkat maneh garwane &lt;a href="Sarah"&gt;Sarah&lt;/a&gt; minangka saudarine, kelairan &lt;a href="Ishak"&gt;Ishak&lt;/a&gt;, pangusiran &lt;a href="Hagar%20%28Alkitab%29"&gt;Hagar&lt;/a&gt;, persengketaan babagan sumur, &lt;a href="pangurbanan%20Ishak"&gt;pangurbanan Ishak&lt;/a&gt; (הָעֲקֵידָה, Akedah).
