<doc id="185245" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185245" title="Chayei Sarah">
Chayei Sarah

Chayei Sarah, Chaye Sarah, utawa Hayye Sarah (חַיֵּי שָׂרָה — &lt;a href="Basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "kauripan &lt;a href="Sarah"&gt;Sarah&lt;/a&gt;," &lt;a href="Incipit"&gt;tembung-tembung kapisan&lt;/a&gt; ing parsyah kasebut) yaiku &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) kalima ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan. Wacaan kasebut ngeliputi Purwaning Dumadi 23:1-25:18. Parsyah kasebut ngisahke crita negosiasi &lt;a href="Abraham"&gt;Abraham&lt;/a&gt; kanggo tuku panggonan pangkebumian garwane Sarah lan misi pelayane kanggo nemoke garwa kanggo putra Abraham, &lt;a href="Ishak"&gt;Ishak&lt;/a&gt;.
Parsyah kasebut kalebu 5.314 aksara Ibrani, 1.402 tembung Ibrani, 105 ayat lan 171 baris ing Gulungan Kitab Torèt (סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה, Sefer Torah). &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; maca iku ing &lt;a href="Sabat"&gt;Sabat&lt;/a&gt; kalima sawise &lt;a href="Simchat%20Torah"&gt;Simchat Torah&lt;/a&gt;, umumne ing November, nanging kadhangkala ing pungkasan Oktober.
