<doc id="185249" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185249" title="Vayishlach">
Vayishlach

Vayishlach utawa Vayishlah (וַיִּשְׁלַח — &lt;a href="basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "lan dhèwèké ngirim," &lt;a href="incipit"&gt;tembung kapisan&lt;/a&gt; saka parsyah kasebut) yaiku &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) kawolu ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan. Ing parsyah kasebut, &lt;a href="Yakub"&gt;Yakub&lt;/a&gt; katemu maneh karo &lt;a href="Esau"&gt;Esau&lt;/a&gt; sawise gelut karo wong "lanang". Pangeran &lt;a href="Shechem%20%28tokoh%20Alkitab%29"&gt;Shechem&lt;/a&gt; ruda peksa &lt;a href="Dinah"&gt;Dinah&lt;/a&gt;, sing saudara-saudarane ngepung kutha &lt;a href="Shechem"&gt;Shechem&lt;/a&gt; minangka balesane. Ing palarian kaluwargane, &lt;a href="Rachel"&gt;Rachel&lt;/a&gt; ngelairke &lt;a href="Benjamin"&gt;Benjamin&lt;/a&gt; lan seda nalika lairan.
Parsyah kasebut ngeliputi Purwaning Dumadi 32:4–36:43. Parsyah kasebut nduweni ayat paling akeh ing wacaan Torèt saben minggu ing Kitab Purwaning Dumadi (parsyah &lt;a href="Miketz"&gt;Miketz&lt;/a&gt; nduweni aksara paling akeh, parsyah &lt;a href="Vayeira"&gt;Vayeira&lt;/a&gt; nduweni tembung paling akeh, lan parsyah &lt;a href="Noach%20%28parsyah%29"&gt;Noach&lt;/a&gt; nduweni cacah ayat sing padha karo parsyah Vayishlach). Wacaan kasebut kalebu 7.458 aksara Ibrani, 1.976 tembung Ibrani, 153 ayat lan 237 baris ing &lt;a href="gulungan%20Kitab%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;gulungan Kitab Torèt&lt;/a&gt; (סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה, Sefer Torah). &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; maca iku ing &lt;a href="Sabat"&gt;Sabat&lt;/a&gt; kawolu sawise &lt;a href="Simchat%20Torah"&gt;Simchat Torah&lt;/a&gt;, ing November utawa Dhésèmber.
