Vayakhel

Vayakhel, Wayyaqhel, VaYakhel, Va-Yakhel, Vayak'hel, Vayak'heil, utawa Vayaqhel (וַיַּקְהֵל) yaiku &lt;a href="Wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t%20Saben%20Minggu"&gt;Wacaan Torèt Saben Minggu&lt;/a&gt; (פָּרָשָׁה, parashah) ka-22 ing siklus &lt;a href="wacaan%20Tor%C3%A8t"&gt;wacaan Torèt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yudaisme"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; taunan lan ka-10 ing &lt;a href="Kitab%20Pangentasan"&gt;Kitab Pangentasan&lt;/a&gt;. Wacaan kasebut ngeliputi Pangentasan 35:1–38:20.
