<doc id="185315" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185315" title="Christopher Hitchens">
Christopher Hitchens

Christopher Eric Hitchens (#ALIH) yaiku pengarang lan jurnalis Inggris-Amerika. Ia sapisan dadi kolumnis lan kritikus sastra ing majalah &lt;a href="The%20Atlantic"&gt;The Atlantic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Majalah%20Vanity%20Fair"&gt;Vanity Fair&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Slate%20%28majalah%29"&gt;Slate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="World%20Affairs%20%28jurnal%29"&gt;World Affairs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Nation"&gt;The Nation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Free%20Inquiry"&gt;Free Inquiry&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi anggota media ing &lt;a href="Hoover%20Institution"&gt;Hoover Institution&lt;/a&gt; ing September 2008. Hitchens asring melu ing acara televisi lan seminar. Ing taun 2005, adhedhasar pemilihan ing majalah &lt;a href="majalah%20Prospect"&gt;Prospect&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="majalah%20Foreign%20Policy"&gt;Foreign Policy&lt;/a&gt;, ia dinobatkan minangka intelektual umum kalima ing donya.
Hitchens menika &lt;a href="antiteisme"&gt;antiteis&lt;/a&gt;. Ia nganggep nek konsep Tuhan menika kepercayaan &lt;a href="totalitarianisme"&gt;totalitarian&lt;/a&gt; sing ngancurke kabebasan wong. Hitchens nulis babagan ateisme lan kritik marang agami ing buku sing nduweni judhul &lt;a href="God%20Is%20Not%20Great"&gt;God Is Not Great&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing &lt;a href="15%20Desember"&gt;15 Desember&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Christopher Hitchens seda ing MD Anderson Cancer Center, &lt;a href="Houston"&gt;Houston&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Texas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt;. Sebab sedane menika radang paru amargi komplikasi kanker sing dideritani.
