<doc id="185740" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185740" title="Yamagata Shinkansen">
Yamagata Shinkansen

Yamagata Shinkansen (山形新幹線, Yamagata Shinkansen) yaiku rute &lt;a href="Mini-shinkansen"&gt;Mini-shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; ing Jepang, dioperasèkaké déning &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR East). Iku nyedhiyakake layanan antarane &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shinj%C5%8D"&gt;Shinjō&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Yamagata"&gt;Prefektur Yamagata&lt;/a&gt; liwat jalur &lt;a href="Tohoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tohoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C5%8Cu%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Ōu&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Operasi</h2>
Operasi.
Sepur kasebut dumadi saka 7 gerbong &lt;a href="E3%20series%20%28train%29"&gt;seri E3&lt;/a&gt; sing beroperasi ing layanan &lt;a href="Tsubasa%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Tsubasa&lt;/a&gt;. Antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Fukushima%20%28Fukushima%29"&gt;Fukushima&lt;/a&gt;, sepur kasebut disambungake karo sepur &lt;a href="Yamabiko"&gt;Yamabiko&lt;/a&gt; ing Tōhoku Shinkansen. Antarane Fukushima lan Shinjō, sepur kasebut lumaku dhewe kanthi kacepetan maksimal 130 km/h lan bareng karo sepur Jalur Utama Ōu reguler.
<h2>Daftar stasiun</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kabeh stasiun sing kapacak ing ngisor iki dumunung ing &lt;a href="%C5%8Cu%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Ōu&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Ing njaba Fukushima, sepur menyang Tokyo budhal nganggo sepur &lt;a href="Tohoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tohoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
