Kabiskopan Agung Napoli (#ALIH; &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Neapolitana) yaiku &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing kidul &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;, tahta sing ana ing &lt;a href="Napoli"&gt;Napoli&lt;/a&gt;. Komunitas &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt; didegake neng kana ing abad ping 1 Masehi lan &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20Napoli"&gt;kabiskopan Napoli&lt;/a&gt; diangkat dadi &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung&lt;/a&gt; ing abad ping 10. Loro Biskop Agung &lt;a href="Napoli"&gt;Napoli&lt;/a&gt; kapilih dadi &lt;a href="Paus%20%28Katulik%29"&gt;Paus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paus%20Paulus%20IV"&gt;Paulus IV&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Paus%20Innosensius%20XII"&gt;Innosensius XII&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing 2004, kabiskopan kasebut nduweni kira-kira 1,600,000 umat sing sampun dibaptis.
Pimpinan Kabiskopan Agung Napoli saikine menika Kardinal &lt;a href="Crescenzio%20Sepe"&gt;Crescenzio Sepe&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Lucio%20Lemmo"&gt;Lucio Lemmo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Gennaro%20Acampa"&gt;Gennaro Acampa&lt;/a&gt; menika biskop auksilier.
