<doc id="185939" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185939" title="Hokuriku Shinkansen">
Hokuriku Shinkansen

Hokuriku Shinkansen (北陸新幹線, Hokuriku Shinkansen) yaiku jalur sepur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur sing dioperasikake bebarengan dening &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR East) lan &lt;a href="West%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;West Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR West), nyambungake Tokyo karo &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kanazawa"&gt;Kanazawa&lt;/a&gt; ing wilayah &lt;a href="Hokuriku"&gt;Hokuriku&lt;/a&gt; Jepang. Bagean kapisan, antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Takasaki"&gt;Takasaki&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nagano"&gt;Nagano&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Nagano"&gt;Prefektur Nagano&lt;/a&gt;, dibukak tanggal 1 Oktober 1997, asline diarani Nagano Shinkansen (長野新幹線, Nagano Shinkansen) (Takasaki disambungake menyang Tokyo dening &lt;a href="J%C5%8Detsu%20Shinkansen"&gt;Jōetsu Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;). Tanggal 14 Maret 2015, didawake menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Toyama"&gt;Toyama&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9fektur%20Toyama"&gt;Préfektur Toyama&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kanazawa"&gt;Kanazawa&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9fektur%20Ishikawa"&gt;Préfektur Ishikawa&lt;/a&gt;. Konstruksi bagean luwih lanjut menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Fukui%20%28Fukui%29"&gt;Fukui&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tsuruga"&gt;Tsuruga&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Fukui"&gt;Prefektur Fukui&lt;/a&gt; diwiwiti ing taun 2012, kanthi jadwal dibukak ing mangsa semi 2024. Rute bagean pungkasan menyang Shin-Osaka diputusake tanggal 20 Desember 2016 minangka rute Osaka–Kyoto, kanthi konstruksi samesthine diwiwiti ing 2030 lan njupuk wektu 15 taun.
<h2>Jeneng sepur lan pola layanan</h2>
Jeneng sepur lan pola layanan.
Wiwit Maret 2015, layanan ing jalur kasebut dipérang dadi papat jinis, kanthi jeneng sepur kaya ing ngisor iki. Sepur lumaku liwat jalur &lt;a href="J%C5%8Detsu%20Shinkansen"&gt;Joetsu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tohoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tohoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; antarane Tokyo lan Takasaki.
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Kagayaki"&gt;Kagayaki&lt;/a&gt;: Tokyo–Tsuruga, layanan winates-mandheg, wiwit 14 Maret 2015</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Hakutaka"&gt;Hakutaka&lt;/a&gt;: Tokyo–Tsuruga, biasane layanan kabeh stasiun, wiwit 14 Maret 2015</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Tsurugi%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Tsurugi&lt;/a&gt;: Toyama–Tsuruga, layanan antar-jemput kabeh stasiun, 14 Maret 2015</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asama%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Asama&lt;/a&gt;: Tokyo–Nagano, umume layanan kabeh stasiun, cocog karo layanan Nagano Shinkansen sing wis ana ing taun 1997</li>
</ul>
