<doc id="186019" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=186019" title="Keabasan Teritorial Subiaco">
Keabasan Teritorial Subiaco

Keabasan Santa Skolastika, uga diarani minangka Keabasan Teritorial Subiaco (&lt;a href="basa%20Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;: Abbazia di Santa Scolastica), ana ing jaba kutha &lt;a href="Subiaco%2C%20Itali"&gt;Subiaco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Roma"&gt;Provinsi Roma&lt;/a&gt;, Wilayah &lt;a href="Lazio"&gt;Lazio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;; lan isih dadi &lt;a href="keabasan%20teritorial"&gt;keabasan teritorial&lt;/a&gt; ordo &lt;a href="Benediktin"&gt;Benediktin&lt;/a&gt; aktif sing asline didegake ing abad ping 6 Masehi dening Santo &lt;a href="Benediktus%20saka%20Nursia"&gt;Benediktus saka Nursia&lt;/a&gt;. Keabasan kasebut ana ing salah sijining guwa (utawa grotto) Subiaco sing dikanggo Benediktus kanggo ngelakoni kegiatan &lt;a href="eremit"&gt;eremit&lt;/a&gt; kapisane. Monasteri kasebut saiki njupuk jeneng saka &lt;a href="Kongregasi%20Subiaco"&gt;Kongregasi Subiaco&lt;/a&gt;, kelompok monasteri ing kabeh donya sing ngeliputi bagean saka &lt;a href="Ordo%20Santo%20Benediktus"&gt;Ordo Santo Benediktus&lt;/a&gt;.
