<doc id="187218" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=187218" title="Kabiskopan Agung Kadinasan Militèr Amérika Sarékat">
Kabiskopan Agung Kadinasan Militèr Amérika Sarékat

Kabiskopan Agung Kadinasan Militer Amerika Sarekat (&lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: Roman Catholic Archdiocese for the Military Services, USA, rasmine diarani Military Ordinariate of Archdiocese for the Military Services of the United States), ngawenehi &lt;a href="pelayanan%20pastoral"&gt;pelayanan pastoral&lt;/a&gt; lan spiritual &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Angkatan%20Bersenjata%20Amerika%20Sarekat"&gt;Angkatan Bersenjata Amerika Sarekat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dependen%20Militer"&gt;sanak sadulure&lt;/a&gt;, lan kabeh basis militer lan angkatan sagara, fasilitas &lt;a href="Administrasi%20Kesehatan%20Veteran"&gt;Administrasi Veteran&lt;/a&gt;, lan layanan federal liyane ing jaban rangkah.
Asline didegake minangka &lt;a href="Ordinariat%20militer"&gt;vikariat militer&lt;/a&gt;, karo &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20New%20York"&gt;Biskop Agung New York&lt;/a&gt; ngejabat minangka vikaris militer. Banjur kuwi didegake maneh minangka &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20agung"&gt;kabiskopan agung&lt;/a&gt; sing nduweni biskop agunge dhewe lan tahta kabiskopan dipindhah menyang &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington, D.C.&lt;/a&gt; dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Yohanes%20Paulus%20II"&gt;Paus Yohanes Paulus II&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1986.
